Package: jetautoclicker
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0
Maintainer: JetAutoClicker maintainers <noreply@example.com>
Description: Autoclicker for Linux (Wayland and X11)
 GTK3 autoclicker with up to 1000 CPS, custom global hotkey and
 xdg-desktop-portal / uinput click backends. Works on KDE Plasma (Wayland).
